### Health Check (Phase 0)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/health

###

### Register Admin (Phase 1)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Admin User",
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### Login Admin (Phase 1)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### Protected Route: Get Profile
# If using cookies (httpOnly): REST Client automatically stores and sends cookies received from login!
GET http://localhost:5000/api/me

###

### Protected Route: If using Bearer Token header instead of cookies
GET http://localhost:5000/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}